      "hook": "If your business stops making money the moment you close your laptop, you don't have a business. You have a job."
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "title": "The $10K Hire You Don't Need",
      "concept": "A direct callout post comparing the cost of hiring a VA or ops manager ($4-10K/month) vs. building a Claude-powered automation stack that handles emails, CRM updates, and client onboarding 24/7. Visual would be a mock job listing crossed out, replaced with a clean Accelod automation architecture diagram (Google Workspace → Claude → N8N → GoHighLevel).",
      "hook": "Stop hiring humans to do robot work. You're not building a team, you're building a payroll problem."
    },
