      "title": "What I'd Automate First (If I Were You)",
      "concept": "Alfie shares the exact 3 workflows he'd build in week one for any service business: lead qualification via Claude, follow-up sequences in GoHighLevel, and internal reporting through Google Workspace, all stitched together with N8N. Visual would be a whiteboard-style breakdown or Alfie talking to camera with workflow overlays animating in.",
      "hook": "Everyone wants AI. Almost nobody knows where to start. Here's exactly what I'd build first if this was my business."
    }
