 N8N</div>\n        <div class=\"col-title cyan\">Quietly closing</div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"dot\">●</span><span>Replied in 47 seconds</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"dot\">●</span><span>Qualified + tagged in CRM</span></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"dot\">●</span><span>Calendar booked. You sleep.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack-row\">\n      <span class=\"stack-pill\">Claude AI</span>\n      <span class=\"stack-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"stack-pill\">N8N</span>\n      <span class=\"stack-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"stack-pill\">GoHighLevel</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"summary\">Your business runs <em>while you sleep</em>.<br>Not because you're lucky. Because it's built right.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"cta-pill\">\n      <span class=\"pulse\"></span>\n      Sound familiar?\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <svg><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n      Accelod AI\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============ FACEBOOK POST (1200x630) ============ -->\n<div id=\"fb-post\">\n  <div class=\"dot-grid\"></div>\n  <div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <svg class=\"watermark\"><use href=\"#claude-star\" style=\"color:#00D4FF\"/></svg>\n\n  <div class=\"fb-top\">\n    <div class=\"fb-badge\">\n      <svg><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n      AI AUTOMATION\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fb-logo\">\n      <svg><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n      Accelod AI\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"fb-body\">\n    <div>\n      <h1 class=\"fb-headline\">The <em>3AM Email</em> Test.</h1>\n      <p class=\"fb-sub\">If your business stops earning when you sleep, it's not a business — <span>it's a job.</span></p>\n      <div class=\"fb-cta\">\n        <span class=\"pulse\"></span>\n        Automate it. Sleep through it.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"fb-stack\">\n      <div class=\"fb-stack-label\">// Powered By</div>\n      <div class=\"fb-tool\">\n        <div class=\"fb-tool-icon dark\">\n          <svg><use href=\"#n8n-logo\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fb-tool-text\">\n          <div class=\"fb-tool-name\">n8n</div>\n          <div class=\"fb-tool-desc\">Workflow automation engine</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fb-tool\">\n        <div class=\"fb-tool-icon\">\n          <svg><use href=\"#gws-logo\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fb-tool-text\">\n          <div class=\"fb-tool-name\">Google Workspace</div>\n          <div class=\"fb-tool-desc\">Gmail, Calendar, Sheets — synced</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fb-tool\">\n        <div class=\"fb-tool-icon dark\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00D4FF,#33E1FF);\">\n          <svg style=\"color:#0B1929\"><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fb-tool-text\">\n          <div class=\"fb-tool-name\">Claude AI + GoHighLevel</div>\n          <div class=\"fb-tool-desc\">Reply, qualify, book — in 47 seconds</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
